    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your powers of shapeshifting outstrip your dabbling in the druidic faith.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Wild shape class feature, Knowledge (nature) 5 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your wild shape ability is calculated as though your druid level were four higher, to a maximum level equal to your character level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/huay#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
